WEBVTT

00:02.270 --> 00:05.860
Half Dead Person:

00:02.270 --> 00:05.860
I killed my heart.

00:06.030 --> 00:06.240
That's why my name is
Half Dead Person.

00:10.280 --> 00:10.490
Only my heart, thus I'm only half dead.
I wouldn't be able to take it any more
if my heart were still alive.

00:15.040 --> 00:17.210
Huh? What the hell is this?

00:17.750 --> 00:19.000
What's this?

00:19.000 --> 00:23.500
"I got stabbed in the back with the sharp
point of a compass during class again today."

00:23.500 --> 00:25.170
Are you serious?

00:34.510 --> 00:34.680
Why can't you scream out? If you're
getting bullied, why don't you just
tell the teacher?

00:34.680 --> 00:37.640
The teacher would notice if I screamed,
so I desperately endured it.
But, no matter how I tried, I still
screamed out. Today, the teacher
glared at me with a strange look.

00:37.930 --> 00:39.520
Is this guy an adult or not?

00:39.520 --> 00:40.730
He's so stupid.

00:40.730 --> 00:40.980
screamed out. Today, the teacher
glared at me with a strange look.

00:41.150 --> 00:41.350
Why can't you scream out? If you're
getting bullied, why don't you just
tell the teacher?

00:42.980 --> 00:43.190
Ratting is the worse thing to do.

00:44.980 --> 00:45.190
That would make the bullying worse.

00:47.360 --> 00:47.530
That guy above is scum.
All he says is (lol) when
you're getting stabbed!

00:47.530 --> 00:47.740
Why not put a metal plate
on your back? (lol)

00:47.900 --> 00:51.660
That guy above is scum.
All he says is (lol) when
you're getting stabbed!

00:52.320 --> 00:54.370
What's the point of getting so serious?

00:54.740 --> 00:54.950
No way such a person could exist lololol

00:58.870 --> 00:59.080
I don't think I can deal with any more
without killing my heart.

01:01.790 --> 01:01.960
Half Dead Person

01:01.960 --> 01:02.130
That's why I'm killing my heart

01:02.630 --> 01:04.630
Half Dead Person:

01:02.630 --> 01:04.630
Until the next person,

01:05.130 --> 01:09.050
becomes their target...

01:12.720 --> 01:14.550
The true forms

01:14.550 --> 01:16.310
Of the things that I gazed at

01:16.430 --> 01:19.890
Were for showing after I closed my eyes

01:17.310 --> 01:20.180
Shigofumi

01:20.140 --> 01:21.980
Again today, time

01:21.980 --> 01:23.610
Will only construct a loneliness

01:23.770 --> 01:27.280
That seems to be torn apart, right?

01:31.200 --> 01:34.660
There are people who can't forget about

01:34.870 --> 01:38.240
The white lotuses that bloom in the darkness

01:38.490 --> 01:41.960
Nevertheless, recollections

01:42.250 --> 01:45.670
Visit from the future

01:45.920 --> 01:53.340
Words that turn into sighs

01:53.340 --> 01:56.930
Are the emerging wings of the soul

01:57.010 --> 02:00.480
Will I flutter apart?

02:00.730 --> 02:04.270
Growing confused and disordered

02:04.400 --> 02:06.730
I want to carve

02:06.730 --> 02:10.190
These letters to you

02:11.740 --> 02:13.570
Pieces of the truth

02:13.570 --> 02:15.370
Of things that I want to tell you-

02:15.450 --> 02:18.950
I can't even send them well to you

02:19.200 --> 02:22.660
If I write them with the blood that stains my fingertips

02:22.870 --> 02:26.290
Then can they spill into your heart?

02:26.540 --> 02:29.460
Even if the one word left behind

02:29.800 --> 02:32.510
To us who live

02:32.510 --> 02:37.850
Is to be goodbye

02:43.890 --> 02:45.900
May I have your attention please?

02:46.190 --> 02:50.480
Starting today, this bag is going to be class's rubbish bin.

02:54.320 --> 02:58.120
Everyone, please give your thanks to Kikukawa-kun.

03:00.790 --> 03:02.040
Here you go.

03:02.580 --> 03:05.500
Actually, bullying happens in our class as well.

03:06.080 --> 03:08.250
It all seems very peaceful though.

03:11.050 --> 03:13.920
Compared to getting stabbed in the back with a compass...

03:13.920 --> 03:16.180
this isn't so bad.

03:29.610 --> 03:32.320
Thank you. Thank you!

03:37.700 --> 03:41.160
Today's Shigofumi looked like a good one.

03:41.160 --> 03:42.950
There are no good or bad ones.

03:42.950 --> 03:46.000
Shigofumis are nothing but honest.

03:46.000 --> 03:48.580
Only humans are dishonest.

03:49.080 --> 03:51.380
All other living creatures are more honest.

03:51.710 --> 03:55.760
Then, why do you wish to become human, Kanaka?

03:55.760 --> 04:00.010
Because, if I became human, then I can lie!

04:10.730 --> 04:11.860
Poor thing.

04:12.270 --> 04:14.150
Survival of the fittest.

04:14.730 --> 04:16.820
That's the rule of nature.

04:20.530 --> 04:23.870
Mikawa Fumika was hospitalised three years ago.

04:24.410 --> 04:26.200
She has been unconscious all this while.

04:27.370 --> 04:32.710
Thus, the girl you saw was a different person.

04:33.290 --> 04:35.670
Mikawa Fumika could not have been walking around.

04:36.050 --> 04:37.380
A different person?

04:37.880 --> 04:38.630
But...

04:42.640 --> 04:43.970
Why?

04:43.970 --> 04:46.970
Why did Mikawa become like that?

04:47.480 --> 04:48.600
Did something happen?

04:51.190 --> 04:53.610
That's right, police officers are sworn to secrecy?

04:54.520 --> 04:57.740
I take pride in my work as a police detective.

04:59.700 --> 05:01.950
Then, just tell me this one thing.

05:04.030 --> 05:07.700
Did Mikawa really shoot her father?

05:10.040 --> 05:10.830
It's true.

05:11.330 --> 05:14.040
The residual gunpowder test confirmed this.

05:20.300 --> 05:22.220
For this problem...

05:22.220 --> 05:26.470
can I have those with seat numbers, 10, 20 and 30, do it?

05:26.470 --> 05:27.350
Yes.

05:33.440 --> 05:35.360
Is Number 10 absent?

05:38.570 --> 05:40.990
Kikukawa, you're Number 10.

05:41.650 --> 05:43.490
What's wrong Kikukawa?

05:43.490 --> 05:45.950
Well... I don't know the answer.

05:50.830 --> 05:52.000
What is it?

05:52.710 --> 05:54.540
Because... you see...

05:57.090 --> 05:59.840
Just do as much as you can. Give it a go.

06:00.340 --> 06:01.720
I don't know the answer.

06:08.310 --> 06:08.470
Evening everyone.

06:13.730 --> 06:13.850
I was forbidden to wear trousers
and underwear to class today.

06:14.770 --> 06:14.940
How embarrassing!!!!!

06:16.810 --> 06:16.980
Looks like the bullying has levelled up.

06:19.320 --> 06:19.480
Question!
Half Dead Person, are you a girl?

06:20.740 --> 06:20.900
Please say that you're a girl!

06:22.320 --> 06:22.490
I'll transfer to your school!

06:28.410 --> 06:28.530
At the end of class, the teacher asked me
to solve a maths problem on the
blackboard. I was so embarrassed.

06:28.530 --> 06:31.910
That's why I tried desperately to kill
my heart. But, it just refuses to die.

06:32.250 --> 06:36.080
You're... Don't tell me, he's...

06:53.430 --> 06:55.020
Half Dead Person.

06:57.060 --> 06:58.610
So, it is you.

07:00.650 --> 07:02.400
Help me, Morishita-kun.

07:02.990 --> 07:04.490
I'm in agony.

07:05.450 --> 07:07.240
I can't take it any more.

07:07.240 --> 07:09.620
Help me, please!

07:09.910 --> 07:11.910
But, what can I do?

07:14.460 --> 07:17.040
I'm begging you, please help me.

07:17.330 --> 07:18.960
Don't rely on others.

07:18.960 --> 07:21.500
Isn't that why you get bullied?

07:21.500 --> 07:22.630
No!

07:22.630 --> 07:25.010
The one getting bullied isn't at fault.

07:25.010 --> 07:26.090
It's the bullies!

07:26.380 --> 07:27.840
I've done nothing wrong.

07:27.840 --> 07:30.550
My attendance is excellent. And I even play basketball.

07:30.890 --> 07:33.140
I take my bath everyday too.

07:33.140 --> 07:35.810
In middle school, I even bullied others.

07:36.310 --> 07:37.600
I know.

07:37.600 --> 07:41.440
No, I'm normal. I've done nothing wrong.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.780
I'm certain.

07:46.070 --> 07:48.780
He looks like he's about to snap.

07:51.030 --> 07:53.200
Kikukawa actually has a friend.

07:54.450 --> 07:57.040
You got it wrong. What are you saying?

07:57.330 --> 07:59.210
You don't have to hide it.

07:59.210 --> 08:02.210
But, it's a good to have such passionate friendship, isn't it?

08:02.210 --> 08:04.510
Would you like to switch places with him then?

08:05.460 --> 08:07.010
Switch places?

08:07.010 --> 08:09.300
Playing dumb again.

08:09.300 --> 08:11.930
One is needed for every class, right?

08:11.930 --> 08:17.060
We need to release the stress of this
constricting school life upon someone.

08:17.060 --> 08:19.560
In other words, one person is needed.

08:19.560 --> 08:23.110
Cut it out. Obviously, he's not my friend.

08:23.110 --> 08:24.280
He gives me the creeps.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.650
Then, prove it to us.

08:46.840 --> 08:47.880
Who's on the line?

08:48.470 --> 08:50.800
<i>It's me, Morishita.</i>

08:51.260 --> 08:52.800
Morishita-kun?

08:52.800 --> 08:55.640
<i>This afternoon, you asked for my help, right?</i>

08:55.640 --> 08:57.100
<i>I'll help you out.</i>

08:57.100 --> 08:59.230
Really? Will you?

08:59.230 --> 09:03.270
<i>Yeah. So can you please come to the school roof now?</i>

09:03.560 --> 09:05.820
The roof, now?

09:05.820 --> 09:08.030
<i>You don't want to be bullied, right?</i>

09:21.670 --> 09:24.210
Morishita-kun, where are you?

09:24.210 --> 09:25.880
It's me, Kikukawa.

09:33.050 --> 09:35.470
Welcome, Kikukawa-kun.

09:35.470 --> 09:38.270
We were thinking of playing a game tonight.

09:39.980 --> 09:41.230
What game?

09:41.730 --> 09:45.190
I saw something very interesting in a manga I read recently.

09:45.480 --> 09:48.570
Morishita, please explain the rules to him.

09:49.190 --> 09:50.360
Morishita-kun?

09:50.650 --> 09:53.490
The rules are simple. Do you see the steel beam there?

09:53.490 --> 09:55.370
You just have to cross to the other side using that.

09:55.370 --> 09:56.200
Huh?

09:56.200 --> 09:59.250
However, you lose if you touch it with your hands.

09:59.250 --> 10:01.500
And you'll have to restart.

10:01.500 --> 10:03.290
No way, we're so high up...

10:03.670 --> 10:06.540
It wasn't easy to carry that steel beam.

10:06.540 --> 10:08.630
You should appreciate our effort.

10:08.630 --> 10:11.220
Please stop this. I'll die.

10:11.720 --> 10:14.180
I'll even shoplift or anything.

10:14.180 --> 10:16.890
Please, have mercy.

10:16.890 --> 10:20.060
Then just cross it. You said that you'd do anything, right?

10:20.350 --> 10:22.180
Grasp the situation.

10:22.180 --> 10:24.310
Please, spare me from doing this.

10:28.610 --> 10:30.820
What are you boys doing?

10:30.820 --> 10:32.650
You're not allowed up here.

10:33.900 --> 10:36.370
Did you get permission from your teacher?

10:36.370 --> 10:40.790
Excuse us. We're from the astronomy society.

10:40.790 --> 10:42.250
We want to see a comet.

10:42.540 --> 10:44.830
But, you can't come up here without permission.

10:46.380 --> 10:47.960
What's wrong with you?

10:48.920 --> 10:51.760
Sorry, I dropped my contact lens.

10:52.170 --> 10:55.430
That's enough, Kikukawa. Thanks.

10:58.970 --> 11:01.600
Sheesh, don't scare me like that.

11:09.610 --> 11:11.320
That was dangerous.

11:11.320 --> 11:13.690
That game was ridiculously dangerous.

11:24.160 --> 11:24.370
Today, I received a phone call from a friend.
He realised I was writing on this board and
told me that he'd help.

11:27.000 --> 11:27.210
Ooh! A saviour has appeared!!

11:28.920 --> 11:29.130
It's a good thing you wrote about this

11:36.050 --> 11:36.220
Half Dead Person:

11:36.880 --> 11:37.050
I'm going out now.
I'll continue later
when I get back.

11:38.220 --> 11:38.390
Good luck!

11:40.550 --> 11:40.720
We'll be waiting.

11:42.720 --> 11:42.890
Don't you guys wonder how
it's going to turn out?

11:44.230 --> 11:44.390
One vote for his friend not coming through.

11:44.390 --> 11:44.520
Are we taking bets now? - lololol

11:44.810 --> 11:47.230
So, he didn't write anything about it.

11:55.820 --> 11:58.780
Anyway, I did what I could to help you today.

11:58.780 --> 12:01.160
It's up to you to help yourself after this.

12:01.450 --> 12:03.120
Half Dead Person.

12:03.120 --> 12:05.120
Shigofumi

12:06.210 --> 12:08.210
Shigofumi

12:14.170 --> 12:16.220
Boys and girls, please be quiet.

12:19.430 --> 12:23.180
Kikukawa Kouichi-kun passed away last night.

12:28.350 --> 12:31.060
Since the hostage situation in the school...

12:31.060 --> 12:34.650
our school has been in the spotlight of bad press.

12:35.610 --> 12:40.160
And because of this incident also,
I'd like everyone to watch what you say and do.

12:46.250 --> 12:49.420
There will be an investigation in the school.

12:49.420 --> 12:52.670
Please don't say anything unnecessary to the press.

12:53.340 --> 12:56.300
Boys and girls, as students here...

12:56.300 --> 12:59.260
please do not embarrass the school.

12:57.210 --> 12:58.920
What an idiot.

13:07.730 --> 13:09.730
Would killing yourself be the normal thing to do?

13:22.320 --> 13:24.450
He really didn't get how things worked.

13:29.910 --> 13:31.370
That's impossible.

13:37.250 --> 13:41.300
Well, I guess he got bullied because he's like that.

13:47.600 --> 13:48.560
What was that?

14:15.420 --> 14:17.500
Looks like things have finally settled down.

14:17.500 --> 14:19.380
Well, a week has passed.

14:19.380 --> 14:21.510
There are lots of other news too.

14:21.800 --> 14:23.590
So it was bullying.

14:23.590 --> 14:25.680
Corpse of a first year student who committed suicide.

14:25.680 --> 14:27.430
What a childish thing to do.

14:28.060 --> 14:30.350
But, I just can't come to terms.

14:31.640 --> 14:38.520
Until recently, I always thought that death
was associated with the elderly or wars abroad.

14:38.820 --> 14:41.360
But, it's incredibly nearby.

14:47.370 --> 14:53.500
I am being bullied.

14:54.210 --> 14:57.290
Up till now, another kid was
getting bullied, and now that he's gone...

14:57.290 --> 14:59.840
I've become the next victim.

15:00.460 --> 15:03.590
Ostracised, graffiti, my stuff hidden from me...

15:04.090 --> 15:05.550
The standard fare of bullying.

15:07.640 --> 15:09.640
But since it happens all day long...

15:10.390 --> 15:12.930
It's far more harsh than I thought it would be.

15:26.570 --> 15:28.740
It's important to get enough iron in your diet.

15:31.790 --> 15:34.660
I feel as if the whole world is against me.

15:38.830 --> 15:43.130
I thought that it'd be worse to be stabbed or beaten up.

15:43.130 --> 15:47.510
But for the first time, I learnt that
mental attacks are actually far more damaging.

15:52.060 --> 15:53.390
Is there anyone else here other than
myself who has been bullied?

15:53.390 --> 15:55.680
Yes.
I have been bullied as well.

16:01.900 --> 16:02.020
Half Dead Person 2:

16:01.900 --> 16:02.020
Really? It's harsh isn't it?

16:05.400 --> 16:05.530
Dumbass!
Of course not. Don't lump me
in the same group you piece of shit.

16:06.900 --> 16:07.030
This guy sure responds fast.

16:07.780 --> 16:07.910
He must have been really happy
to have found a buddy.

16:10.950 --> 16:12.410
Kill...

16:12.410 --> 16:14.240
I'll kill my heart.

16:17.460 --> 16:20.210
Sooner or later, a new victim will be chosen.

16:24.420 --> 16:26.920
Until it's over, I'm half dead.

16:28.090 --> 16:29.970
Not entirely dead.

16:29.970 --> 16:32.430
Only half of me is dead.

16:34.310 --> 16:36.100
What a boring guy.

16:46.110 --> 16:47.820
What do you guys want today?

16:47.820 --> 16:51.200
Morishita, your reactions have disappointed us lately.

16:51.200 --> 16:54.990
I figured that we should have some
fun by having you play a game with us.

16:54.990 --> 16:55.950
Game?

16:59.620 --> 17:02.130
Stop! Please stop!

17:02.420 --> 17:05.090
We're going to use a blindfold today.

17:05.840 --> 17:07.300
Blindfold?

17:09.090 --> 17:10.590
Don't be crazy.

17:10.590 --> 17:12.470
I'll definitely fall.

17:12.470 --> 17:16.060
It'll be all right. It's a game, so all you have to do is win.

17:16.470 --> 17:18.230
What the hell is this?

17:18.230 --> 17:21.480
Will they not change victims unless the victim dies?

17:21.770 --> 17:25.690
You're giving up? Why? You can't run away.

17:32.740 --> 17:34.490
Who are you?

17:34.490 --> 17:35.700
A student from our school?

17:37.290 --> 17:39.960
What are you planning to do? Look at those clothes.

17:41.080 --> 17:42.420
Don't touch me so cordially.

17:43.420 --> 17:44.880
W-Why you!

17:46.380 --> 17:47.710
What the hell are you doing?

17:55.390 --> 17:58.310
I told you not to use me as a weapon.

17:58.310 --> 18:01.440
Y-You saved me. Thank you.

18:01.940 --> 18:03.480
I...

18:05.400 --> 18:06.520
A letter?

18:06.520 --> 18:07.820
It's a Shigofumi.

18:07.820 --> 18:09.940
A letter from the world of the departed.

18:09.940 --> 18:10.740
Huh?

18:11.110 --> 18:13.860
The sender is Kikukawa Kouichi.

18:20.160 --> 18:22.210
Morishita Shunsuke-kun,

18:22.210 --> 18:25.080
Do you now understand how I felt?

18:25.080 --> 18:27.630
It's harsh and agonising, isn't it?

18:27.630 --> 18:32.130
You understand how hard
I searched for a helping hand now, don't you?

18:33.380 --> 18:37.600
In spite of that, you joined that bunch to bully me.

18:37.600 --> 18:39.260
Serves you right.

18:39.260 --> 18:42.980
Die. Die. Die only in the heart.

18:42.980 --> 18:44.560
Much more awaits you.

18:47.940 --> 18:49.610
Why did he say that to me?

18:50.230 --> 18:52.610
Didn't I help you?

18:56.570 --> 18:58.370
Who was that?

18:58.370 --> 19:00.240
Must be one of Morishita's acquaintances.

19:00.540 --> 19:03.410
In that case, you're gonna be the one accountable, right?

19:07.750 --> 19:08.840
Wait!

19:09.590 --> 19:11.340
Don't you dare run!

19:11.670 --> 19:14.470
The game isn't over yet.

19:14.470 --> 19:16.090
Round 2.

19:16.090 --> 19:17.800
Rejoice!

19:17.800 --> 19:20.260
We're gonna have fun till daybreak.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.400
Come on, stand up!

19:27.400 --> 19:28.650
Use your "continue".

19:29.190 --> 19:33.360
Die. Die. Die only in the heart.

19:34.740 --> 19:36.570
Come on, cross.

19:36.570 --> 19:38.370
Don't forget your blindfold.

19:38.370 --> 19:39.370
No!

19:42.040 --> 19:44.410
Why are you resisting?

19:45.500 --> 19:47.210
Shall we change the game to soccer instead?

19:48.040 --> 19:49.630
Night time kick-off.

19:49.630 --> 19:51.210
Let's have a good match.

19:57.130 --> 19:59.970
Come on, cry or something.

19:59.970 --> 20:02.350
Kikukawa was much more fun.

20:12.400 --> 20:14.070
H-Hey...

20:14.820 --> 20:17.570
What the hell... is this?

20:18.610 --> 20:20.820
Is this... for real?

20:41.970 --> 20:44.560
Ah, he's really done it now.

20:44.560 --> 20:47.730
He shows his true nature for those scumbags.

20:47.730 --> 20:51.400
He fought to protect himself.

20:51.400 --> 20:53.270
An eye for an eye?

20:53.570 --> 20:55.780
Only a primitive person would do that.

20:56.610 --> 20:59.570
Humans are societal creatures, aren't they?

20:59.570 --> 21:03.240
Correct. He's now socially dead.

21:03.240 --> 21:04.200
But...

21:04.990 --> 21:07.160
As an animal, he survives.

21:28.140 --> 21:28.270
At around 11 pm on the 11th on the
roof of Kamome East High School.
Student F was assaulted by a fellow
student, and is now unconscious and
in critical condition.
It appears to be a single case.
The police are currently investigating
boy A, who stabbed boy F.

21:29.140 --> 21:29.270
So, boy A is actually Half Dead Person 2?

21:30.520 --> 21:30.640
Oh, the one who got bullied.

21:31.770 --> 21:31.900
But, killing just because of that?

21:32.150 --> 21:32.230
I have to be careful too.

21:36.650 --> 21:36.690
Idiot

21:36.650 --> 21:36.690
S cum

21:36.650 --> 21:36.690
Gross

21:38.280 --> 21:38.400
Haven't you guys done it at least once
or twice before too?

21:41.530 --> 21:41.660
Looks like we have a bully here!

21:44.030 --> 21:44.120
Well, in a quarrel, both parties are
to blame? Something like that.

21:44.030 --> 21:44.120
Anon:

21:44.030 --> 21:44.120
That has a different meaning.

21:53.250 --> 21:58.090
Shigofumi

21:53.250 --> 21:58.090
Episode Six

21:53.250 --> 21:58.090
Scream

21:56.250 --> 21:57.630
Hello?

23:28.850 --> 23:30.350
Time comes to a stand still.

23:30.850 --> 23:32.770
Thoughts of a distant dream.

23:33.600 --> 23:36.650
I <i>will</i> end this once and for all.

23:38.060 --> 23:40.110
